  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Council of Disabled Persons of Zimbabwe (NCDPZ) - Livelihoods Protection &amp; Promotion Zim</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To protect and promote the livelihoods of approximately 400 disabled people and most vulnerable households with disabled children through a combination of interventions including provision of start up capital for IGAs, business skills training, empowerment programmes, provision of water and sanitation facilities and mitigation of the impact of HIV &amp; AIDS</narrative>
  </description>
